 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) O-lan speaks cautiously.",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"It is better to have it gone than to be beaten for it. And I shall sell my bed---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"Why---why---\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) O-lan explains that she will sell her bed to show she is willing to give up everything for the family.",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"I shall sell my bed and buy a brick bed for myself. I shall sell my quilt and buy a coarse quilt for myself. I shall sell my chair and buy a stool for myself. I shall sell my table and buy a wooden tray. I shall sell my bedclothes and buy linen for the children. And I shall sell my shoes and buy cloth shoes for myself.\"",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"I have said---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"Tell me then, why do you wish to sell these things?\"",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"I wish to sell them that you may see that I will give up everything---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"But why---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"Why then---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"Tell me why!\"",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"I wish to sell them because I wish to give you---\"",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"---two small white pearls.\"",
  "[silence] O-lan says nothing.",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"Now, what is this?\"",
  "[action] (to O-lan) Wang Lung stares at O-lan, surprised.",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"Why should you wish to give me those---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"We shall need them ourselves.\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[silence] O-lan says nothing."
